Brand
  JEON DE VERO name, logo marks and mascot: the client's own. Supplied by the client: reference/jdv_logo_sheet.webp
  (the oval, peek, sign, pennant and other marks, and the drawn head used for the character), reference/jdv_skate_poster.webp
  (the character's look and the ollie pose; also hung in the shop), reference/jdv_store_reference_v2.webp (the shop).
  tools/extract_art.py cuts the marks from the sheet; nothing is redrawn except the mirrored head, whose cap lettering
  is re-set unmirrored. The 3D shop set is ../jdv-store (built for the client in this repository).

Music and sound
  Original score, composed and synthesised for this film (numpy; no samples, no third-party recordings).
  Projector sounds synthesised. No voice.
